<p align="left"><b><font size="3">OMG! An update! :P&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">November 13. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Yea yea, I know :) Long time no seen :) Well, what can I say,
life in Darksphere goes on as it has for some time. Camping out on the mobs we
want, upgrading our members equipment, having fun and kicking but when we need
to. Some people left and I wish you all a good fare well and good luck in the
time to come. Old faces returned, good to see them, new faces appeared, may your
time in DS be as good as my time have been so far :)</p>
<p align="center"><font size="3"><b>Clerics!!!</b></font></p>
<p align="left"><b>We need you! :)</b></p>
<p align="left">Yea I wont hide it, but we had a few of our active clerics
leaving or going inactive, so we got in a bit of a shortage here :P It wont stop
us from doing anything we haven't done in the past, but we are looking for some
serious cleric players here at Darksphere. We have lowered the level requirement
to level 54 for clerics, giving you a fair chance to catch up with us. Please
contact either Tayen or myself in game, leave us a mail, or write an application
on the boards :) thanks!</p>
<p align="left">What did we kill? Well, I believe Vindicator ate it a few more
times, Servitor was vanquished, Lcea stopped playing her lute once too many
(thank god), and we completed a few epics :) Got 2 Darksphere first epics
actually. A BIG Grats to Orduhre, our newly appointed officer and wielder of the
staff of Skittles! :P Grats Ord!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="OrdEpic.jpg" width="317" height="463"></p>
<p align="left">Another big grats to Twopaw, our first and so far only Beastlord,
now with epic! Picture inc as soon as I see you in game again :P</p>
<p align="left"><b>Quotes from Kangazcon :P</b></p>
<p align="left">That boy sure unfolds in this weeks issue of <a href="http://www.darksphereguild.com">www.darksphereguild.com</a></p>
<p align="left">Why are tanks so jealous of shammy slow? :P</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/147.jpg" width="243" height="13"></p>
<p align="left">ummm, this must be a &quot;ding 60, Warlord!&quot; syndrome</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/148.jpg" width="364" height="14"></p>
<p align="left">no comment :D</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/149.jpg" width="538" height="16"></p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">Untill next time kids! :)</p>


